column508:
01/Aug/26 3:33 PM;621f1c4f94f7e20069fdd50c;At present,  account currency is not sent in the request JSON. We need account currency in request to match with the Cadebill account currency.

As discussed, I am sharing the expected placement of fields in the request JSON.

 

@Rahul Bais: Please review the JSON and let us know the feasibility of adding “_account_no_” and “_account_currency_id_”  fields in the JSON.

 

{

  "data": {

    "request_id": "20260727130252-4174",

    *"account_no": 4605294,*

    *"account_currency_id": 289,*

    "customer_product_details": [{}],

    "account_volume_discount": [{}]

  }

}

