column36:
{color:#172b4d}On Enterise tasks, clouser fields in Wiser are overwriten by empty clouser fields from Jira.{color}

{color:#172b4d}Therefore, Integration will update their logic so that the following fields will be integrated from Jira to Wiser only for Actimize tasks:{color}

{color:#172b4d}Resolution Type{color}

{color:#172b4d}Regression{color}

However, upon further investigation we believe that the issue might be due to the changes in client-side form initialization between various versions. We can modify this script to include "isLoading" check as it is generally considered a good practice when the script should only respond to user-initiated changes and should not execute during form initialization for onChange Client Scripts.

For testing purpose, We have updated the script to exclude execution during form loading using the "isLoading/isTemplate" check. The issue has been resolved and the existing functionality remains unchanged for user-initiated field changes.

if (isLoading || isTemplate) {     
    return;     
}

We would request you to add the above mentioned script in the respective client script and see if that resolves the issue that you are facing?

Please let us know if you have any further questions.
